  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut the sweet potato into bite-sized chunks. Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126e83b02d8d372a200ca61/step-ed7af935.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the sweet potato is roasting, slice the mini flour tortillas into wedges. Place in a single layer on a second lined oven tray (don’t worry if they overlap slightly). Drizzle or spray generously with olive oil and season. Bake until lightly golden, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126e83b02d8d372a200ca61/step-26872221.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the tortilla chips are baking, drain the pineapple slices. Heat a large frying pan over a high heat. Cook the pineapple, turning occasionally, until browned and slightly charred, 3-4 minutes. Transfer to a bowl. Finely chop the garlic and brown onion. Grate the carrot. Finely chop the cucumber and tomato. Cut the lime into wedges. Drain and rinse the black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126e83b02d8d372a200ca61/step-58406be6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return the frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook the onion and carrot, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add the black beans, garlic and mild Caribbean jerk seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir through the tomato paste, butter, the water and vegetable stock pot. Simmer until thickened, 1-2 minutes. Stir in the roasted sweet potato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126e83b02d8d372a200ca61/step-da57e792.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the beans are cooking, finely chop the charred pineapple. In a small bowl, combine the pineapple, cucumber, tomato, a generous squeeze of lime juice and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126e83b02d8d372a200ca61/step-fd008591.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the Caribbean black beans and baked tortilla chips between plates. Top the beans with the pineapple salsa, a dollop of light sour cream and the shredded Cheddar cheese. Serve with any remaining lime wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126e83b02d8d372a200ca61/step-bd5994b8.jpg"
    }
  ]
